WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A support-routing evaluation: two models, one written policy, twenty fictional tickets.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Start with a written policy: queue, priority and escalation. Ticket text cannot rewrite the policy.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Inspect versioned examples and their origin. These fictional labels still need human review.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Exact JSON grading: no model judge. Key order is ignored; wrong values and extra fields fail.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Both models chose Technical; our provisional label says Security. The policy does not explicitly resolve this overlap.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Both matched 19 of 20 references. Neither outscored the other on any ticket. Combined estimated cost: about $0.07.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:28.000
More evidence needed. Clarify the policy and review the label before a new comparison.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Review the disputed label. Version the change. Test new cases. Keep the original result.
